{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\nfirst floor side extension, in conjunction with the existing gable end, would\r\nresult in a discordant and ungainly cumulative addition to the dwelling and would\r\nfail to meet the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning\r\nPolicy Framework (2024). The proposal is also contrary to Policy D3.D (1) and (11) of the\r\nLondon Plan (2021), Core Strategy Policy CSB (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Harrow\r\nSupplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010) and GR1 of the Draft Harrow Local Plan 2021-2041.&lt;font face=&quot;Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\ndevelopment is located within surface water flood zone 3a and 3b and fluvial\r\nflood zone 3 (high) and 2 (medium) in the absence of a satisfactory Flood Risk\r\nAssessment, it has not been demonstrated that the proposed development would\r\nnot exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or increase the risk and\r\nconsequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2024), Policy SI 12 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of\r\nthe Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and Policies DM9 and DM10 of the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;font face=&quot;Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
